Three arcs of the circle, all meeting at one point.

Cover the circle by U1, U2 and U3.
The transition on U1 and U2 is 0.
The transition on U2 and U3 is 0.
The transition on U3 and U1 is 1.
The triple overlap of U1, U2 and U3 is not empty.
One checks the cocycle condition.
By gluing.
Without loss of generality, it glues.
QED.
